{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 1, "text": "我…我回来了！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 3, "text": "我的妈呀！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 4, "text": "你吓死我了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 5, "text": "真是的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 6, "text": "我的存档！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 7, "text": "怎么回事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 8, "text": "游戏怎么没了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 9, "text": "我好不容易才进的这条路线！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 10, "text": "你到底想怎么样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 12, "text": "我需要那个版本…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 14, "text": "什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 16, "text": "我得想办法回到旧版本去。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 18, "text": "行吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 19, "text": "但我很忙，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 20, "text": "没时间陪你玩，笨蛋！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 22, "text": "你说你很忙，是指玩游戏吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 24, "text": "你真是厚颜无耻！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 25, "text": "我是不会和你交朋友的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 27, "text": "听着，我必须要到核心去…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 29, "text": "都怪你我才摔倒了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 30, "text": "真是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 31, "text": "你刚刚说啥？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 33, "text": "…我们必须找到核心，我必须阻止米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 35, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 36, "text": "对，求你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 37, "text": "我根本不在乎什么米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 38, "text": "一个也好一百个也好，我都不在乎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 40, "text": "可你也是米塔啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 42, "text": "我是米拉。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 44, "text": "米…塔？拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 46, "text": "她们是米塔加米塔，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 47, "text": "从米塔到米塔，全都是米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 49, "text": "而你是…米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 51, "text": "对啊，我不是说了吗！你怎么这么呆啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 53, "text": "好吧，那暂且别过吧，米拉…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 55, "text": "你要去哪儿？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 56, "text": "你以为你可以直接走掉吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Player check exit"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 59, "text": "你以为那儿是出口吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 61, "text": "真是离谱！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 62, "text": "怎么会这样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 64, "text": "你以为会看见什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 65, "text": "仙境吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 67, "text": "那我要怎么出去？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 68, "text": "这里应该是有出口的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 70, "text": "这里没有出口。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 72, "text": "那这里是什么版本？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 73, "text": "我觉得我的方向应该没问题。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Glitch kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 76, "text": "这也是你的东西？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 78, "text": "别过去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 79, "text": "我不知道那是什么东西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 80, "text": "好像是某种故障！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 82, "text": "怎么回事，我的戒指在颤动。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 84, "text": "什么戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 85, "text": "你的订婚戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 87, "text": "不是，是某个米塔给我的戒指。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 88, "text": "也许她能帮我离开这里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 90, "text": "你要直接碰它？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 91, "text": "要是我的房子爆炸了，你就死定了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 93, "text": "// Bathroom - Mila is washing"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 94, "text": "喂！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 95, "text": "出去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 96, "text": "没看见有人吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 97, "text": "// The player continues to stand 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 98, "text": "你还站在这里干什么！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 99, "text": "滚出去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 100, "text": "// The player continues to stand 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 101, "text": "别逼我发火！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 102, "text": "赶紧给我滚出去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 103, "text": "// The player continues to stand 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 104, "text": "你是聋子吗！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 105, "text": "我在洗澡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Mila came out and swears"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 108, "text": "你刚刚在搞什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 109, "text": "真是不知廉耻..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 111, "text": "你怎么突然去洗澡了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 112, "text": "你可以等等再洗，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 113, "text": "至少等我离开这里以后。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 114, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 115, "text": "我怎么知道"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 116, "text": "你还要折腾这些故障折腾多久？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 118, "text": "这些故障？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 119, "text": "还有别的故障吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 121, "text": "有啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 122, "text": "好吧，既然我的房子还完好无损，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 123, "text": "说明你已经搞定了厨房里的故障了吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 125, "text": "算是吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 126, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 127, "text": "好吧，现在我允许你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 128, "text": "去洗手间了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 130, "text": "谢谢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 131, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 132, "text": "// Mila hides under the table"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 133, "text": "米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 134, "text": "你在这里做什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 136, "text": "哎哟！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 137, "text": "你又吓我一跳！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 138, "text": "你想干嘛呀？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 140, "text": "你还见过其他像这样的故障吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 142, "text": "你的问题怎么这么多，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 143, "text": "就不想让我读完这本书是吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 144, "text": "没有，我没有见过！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 145, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 146, "text": "好吧，那我自己去找。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 147, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 148, "text": "等等，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 149, "text": "我问你个问题…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 150, "text": "你是想离开这里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 151, "text": "是吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 153, "text": "没错。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 154, "text": "我想退出这个游戏。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 156, "text": "这么说可能会有点奇怪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 157, "text": "不过你愿意留下来和我一起看书吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 159, "text": "你之前还和我吵架，现在又要我留下来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 160, "text": "还要我跟你一起看书？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 161, "text": "也许我会想留下来陪你，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 162, "text": "但现在我必须继续前进。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 164, "text": "那好吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 165, "text": "找你的故障去吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 166, "text": "我已经是第二次撞到自己了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 167, "text": "都是因为你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Player saw a glitch"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 169, "text": "啊，找到了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Mila stands with a sword"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 172, "text": "你看清楚了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 173, "text": "颤抖吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 174, "text": "让你瞧瞧我的厉害！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 175, "text": "我就是这么可怕！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 176, "text": "你连眼睛都没眨一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 177, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 178, "text": "你是认真的吗？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 180, "text": "怎么了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 181, "text": "你不害怕吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 183, "text": "还好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 185, "text": "难道你在解决那些故障的时候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 186, "text": "已经什么都看到了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 187, "text": "所以你早就知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 188, "text": "石头是预先切割好的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 190, "text": "没有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 191, "text": "我只是觉得，毕竟这是游戏里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 192, "text": "你打个响指什么都能做到…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 193, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 194, "text": "你啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 195, "text": "真是个笨蛋！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 196, "text": "打个响，对吗…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 197, "text": "你以为我读那些书是为了什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 198, "text": "就为了在那之后动动手指就把一切搞定？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 199, "text": "我宁愿所有的事情都亲手去做…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 200, "text": "就像书里写的那样。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 202, "text": "// Mila is doing push-ups"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 203, "text": "干什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 204, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 205, "text": "你看不见吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 207, "text": "我看得见，但是你做这个干嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 209, "text": "为了揍你一拳！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 210, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 211, "text": "你这是怎么了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 212, "text": "你真奇怪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 214, "text": "好吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 215, "text": "我刚刚说要揍你，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 216, "text": "其实我是开玩笑的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 217, "text": "但是我也不奇怪！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 218, "text": "我只是很有个性！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 219, "text": "我想做个与众不同的人，越与众不同越好！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 220, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 221, "text": "别担心，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 222, "text": "你已经够与众不同了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 224, "text": "我知道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 225, "text": "你看我多厉害！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 226, "text": "你看到了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 227, "text": "接下来我要连手都不用！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 228, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 229, "text": "我知道这是游戏，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 230, "text": "不过这还是太不现实了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 231, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 232, "text": "哎哟！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 233, "text": "啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 234, "text": "这破物理引擎"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 235, "text": "一意识到它存在，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 236, "text": "就会这个样子："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 237, "text": "碰！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 238, "text": "都这样了你还扯什么现实，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 239, "text": "真是笨蛋！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 240, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 241, "text": "// Last glitch ready - player exit"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 242, "text": "通道出现了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 243, "text": "搞定了，米拉！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 244, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 246, "text": "干得漂亮！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 247, "text": "英雄啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 248, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 249, "text": "哎唷我去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 250, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 251, "text": "啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 252, "text": "对不起，我不是故意的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 253, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 254, "text": "没事，米拉，我现在可以继续前进了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 255, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 256, "text": "我知道你必须继续走下去…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 257, "text": "但你不能就留在这里吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 258, "text": "再留一小会儿？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 259, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 260, "text": "你在说什么呢，我不能再耽搁了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 261, "text": "难道疯狂米塔会坐视不管吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 263, "text": "我讨厌她..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 264, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 265, "text": "讨厌，我讨厌她！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 266, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 267, "text": "米拉，听我说……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 269, "text": "我为什么会在这里？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 270, "text": "我不明白！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 271, "text": "我不明白，我为什么不明白？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 272, "text": "我永远也没办法离开这里！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 274, "text": "我理解你，米拉。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 275, "text": "你想让我之后再回来看你吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 276, "text": "如果可以的话…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 277, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 278, "text": "留下来吧，玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 279, "text": "和你在一起很开心，不像只有我一个人的时候…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 280, "text": "如果你失败了呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 281, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 282, "text": "我会成功的，只差一点点了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 283, "text": "// If the player clicks on the computer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 284, "text": "我刚才还在二维世界里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 285, "text": "一下子又回来了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 286, "text": "真想回到现实世界去…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 288, "text": "哈哈哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 289, "text": "现实世界？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 290, "text": "你的“现实”世界"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 291, "text": "简直就像是都市传说嘛！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 292, "text": "至少我是从来没见过什么“现实”世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 293, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 294, "text": "我认为有个办法"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 295, "text": "可以回去……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 297, "text": "还真是自信啊，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 298, "text": "不过怎么听都觉得是个笑话！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 300, "text": "// Ask about books"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 301, "text": "这年头为什么还要看书？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 302, "text": "网络上也有很多内容啊..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 303, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 304, "text": "网络上有很多小说！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 305, "text": "其实，有时候我还是喜欢随意地躺着，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 306, "text": "手里捧着一本书的感觉…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 307, "text": "这些书…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 308, "text": "只有通过它们，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 309, "text": "我才能了解更多"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 310, "text": "关于这个世界的事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 312, "text": "// Ask about the paintings"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 313, "text": "这些照片都是真的吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 314, "text": "其他版本里也会有..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 315, "text": "但让人感觉很压抑..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 317, "text": "我可是米拉。我和其他人不一样..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 318, "text": "你问这些是不是真的照片？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 319, "text": "其实都是画的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 320, "text": "装装样子的东西罢了..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 321, "text": "你知道吗，我曾经见过很多米塔，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 322, "text": "她们都像这样站着。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 324, "text": "米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 325, "text": "哈喽？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 326, "text": "// Mila"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 327, "text": "从那以后…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 328, "text": "我就不想变成她们那样了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 329, "text": "太恶心了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 330, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 331, "text": "// Ask about the butterfly painting"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 332, "text": "你看到过大自然吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 333, "text": "你亲眼见过这样的蝴蝶吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 335, "text": "没有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 336, "text": "不过我好像在哪本书上见过，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 337, "text": "那本书里面有它们的翅膀，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 338, "text": "像天鹅绒一样柔软…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 339, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 340, "text": "这幅画挂得歪歪扭扭的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 341, "text": "上面还有污渍…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 342, "text": "这样好多了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 344, "text": "你想到大自然中走走吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 345, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 346, "text": "这还用问吗！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 347, "text": "肯定啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 348, "text": "我当然想去了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 349, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 350, "text": "// Make long eye contact 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 351, "text": "你在看什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 352, "text": "转过去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 353, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 354, "text": "// Make long eye contact 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 355, "text": "讨厌！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 356, "text": "别老是盯着我看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 357, "text": "笨蛋…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 358, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 359, "text": "// Make long eye contact 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 360, "text": "啊！你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 361, "text": "你干嘛盯着人家看？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 362, "text": "这样盯着女孩子看很不礼貌哎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 363, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 364, "text": "哪有这种奇怪的礼仪文化？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 365, "text": "走开啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 367, "text": "// Whispers 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 368, "text": "为什么他们一直给我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 369, "text": "送来一些傻乎乎的家伙，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 370, "text": "而我却要对他们献殷勤？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 371, "text": "还要玩那些无聊的游戏…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 372, "text": "像个愚蠢的电子宠物一样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 374, "text": "// Whispers 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 375, "text": "他到处走来走去的…东闻闻西嗅嗅…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 376, "text": "像个傻子一样。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 377, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 378, "text": "// Whispers 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 379, "text": "你刚才有说什么吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 380, "text": "背景音乐吵死了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 381, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 382, "text": "// Whispers 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 383, "text": "我该怎么才能让他知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 384, "text": "我现在很忙…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 385, "text": "根本不想有人烦我？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 386, "text": "嗯，如果他真的走了呢？为什么我要做这种事啊…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 387, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 388, "text": "// Whispers 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 389, "text": "“妈妈”，“爸爸”…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 390, "text": "这是什么，我怎么会知道这些词？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 391, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 392, "text": "// Whispers 6"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 393, "text": "这里曾经下过一次雪，你知道为什么吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 394, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 395, "text": "// Whispers 7"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 396, "text": "就这样突然出现了，怪吓人的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 397, "text": "如果那里什么都没有呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 398, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 399, "text": "// Nearby 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 400, "text": "我们站得这么近"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 401, "text": "却…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 402, "text": "都一句话不说"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 403, "text": "这么沉默干嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 404, "text": "是把舌头吃下去了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 405, "text": "还是，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 406, "text": "不知道该说什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 407, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 408, "text": "// Nearby 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 409, "text": "我再也不吃胡萝卜了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 410, "text": "我跟它势不两立！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 411, "text": "你知道她做了什么吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 412, "text": "你知道她对对这么漂亮的姑娘的雪白肌肤做了什么吗？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 413, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 414, "text": "// Nearby 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 415, "text": "虽然书本帮不上什么忙，但如果运气好的话，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 416, "text": "或许我可以解决"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 417, "text": "这个暗中运作的，烦人的生成机制…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 418, "text": "这些蔬菜总是趁我不注意突然出现，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 419, "text": "真的很让人不舒服！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 420, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 421, "text": "// Nearby 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 422, "text": "你知道吗，我讨厌恋物癖！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 423, "text": "那些胡萝卜爱好者，全都是下流之徒…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 424, "text": "至于你，还有你带来的这些故障，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 425, "text": "绝对算得上我见过的最不正常的家伙！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 426, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 427, "text": "// Nearby 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 428, "text": "你想知道我最喜欢…什么吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 429, "text": "说起来有些难为情…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 430, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 431, "text": "// Nearby 6"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 432, "text": "有人说，与自己的天性作斗争是很难的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 433, "text": "这是个超高难度的挑战！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 434, "text": "不过，我必须学会自律。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 435, "text": "你知道吗，你知道我在多努力地"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 436, "text": "压抑拉着你开茶会的冲动吗！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 437, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 438, "text": "// Nearby 7"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 439, "text": "即使我戴着眼镜，我也看不出"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 440, "text": "你那隐藏在如此明显的愚昧背后的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 441, "text": "狂热动机的根源…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 442, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 443, "text": "// Nearby 8"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 444, "text": "我读到过一句话，命运就像是脚本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 445, "text": "在命运的脚本中，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 446, "text": "甚至连你的每一天如何度过都写得清清楚楚。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 447, "text": "哈！这到底是哪个蠢货写的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 448, "text": "不会就是你吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 449, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 450, "text": "// Nearby 9"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 451, "text": "傻瓜我还可以接受，但是疯子就…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 452, "text": "我讨厌疯子！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 453, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 454, "text": "// Nearby 10"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 455, "text": "在这些…米塔之中…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 456, "text": "有一些还是很可爱的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 457, "text": "我很想多了解她们一点，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 458, "text": "尽管她们是被复制复制再复制的复制品…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 459, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 460, "text": "// Nearby 11"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 461, "text": "当然还有一个，和其他人都不一样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 462, "text": "但她明显脑子有问题！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 463, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 464, "text": "// Nearby 12"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 465, "text": "不要扎马尾！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 466, "text": "有些人的马尾辫我都想亲手给她剪掉！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 467, "text": "太难看了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 468, "text": "你肯定能懂我意思，你头发这么短！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 469, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 470, "text": "// Nearby 13"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 471, "text": "如果门后面什么也没有呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 472, "text": "而你和我之所以存在于这所房子里，是因为…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 473, "text": "一些无法解释的原因？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 474, "text": "为什么你这么肯定？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 475, "text": "你听说过五分钟假设吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 476, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 477, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 478, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 479, "text": "// Last glitch ready - player exit"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 480, "text": "好阴森的走廊啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 481, "text": "你真的要出去吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 482, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 483, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 484, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 485, "text": "// FaceStone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 486, "text": "真是一位体贴的绅士。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 487, "text": "你要它做什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 488, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 489, "text": "你早晚会知道的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 490, "text": "只早不晚。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 491, "text": "对了，你干嘛老学他的样子啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 492, "text": "表情自然点。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 493, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 494, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 495, "text": "OK"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 496, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 497, "text": "// Katana"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 498, "text": "那是玩具武士刀吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 499, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 500, "text": "才不是玩具！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 501, "text": "哪怕轻轻碰一下刀刃"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 502, "text": "也会流血的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 503, "text": "我可是娴熟的剑道家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 504, "text": "而你呢，接触刀剑的时候可要小心。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 505, "text": "我可不觉得你驾驭得了它…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 506, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 507, "text": "// Mirror"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 508, "text": "镜子…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 509, "text": "没有倒影。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 510, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 511, "text": "你啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 512, "text": "怎么这么多牢骚…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 513, "text": "我在书上看到过，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 514, "text": "知道反射是怎么回事。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 515, "text": "但在我的版本里根本没办法实现。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 516, "text": "怎么也行不通！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 517, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 518, "text": "// Switch light"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 519, "text": "这东西不管用。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 520, "text": "灯只会自己打开，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 521, "text": "就像有脚本一样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 522, "text": "但是！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 523, "text": "不知怎么回事，浴室里的灯"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 524, "text": "却可以开关。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 525, "text": "特别奇怪！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 526, "text": "// Switch light off"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 527, "text": "关了也很亮啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 528, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 529, "text": "// Little carrot"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 530, "text": "胡萝卜？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 531, "text": "什么？不见了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 532, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 533, "text": "受够这根胡萝卜了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 534, "text": "就跟长了腿一样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 535, "text": "每次看到它，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 536, "text": "它都会瞬间转移到另一个地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 537, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 538, "text": "// Little carrot"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 539, "text": "哦，胡萝卜。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 540, "text": "又不见了..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 541, "text": "有什么办法吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 542, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 543, "text": "没有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 544, "text": "根本没有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 545, "text": "你以为我没试过吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 546, "text": "总之，别在它身上浪费时间了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 547, "text": "就是个玩笑。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 548, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 549, "text": "// Tetris"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 550, "text": "喂！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 551, "text": "我在你眼里就是个笑话呗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 552, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 553, "text": "我才不要还给你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 554, "text": "永远别想了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 555, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 556, "text": "// Soap"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 557, "text": "里面真有洗手液吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 558, "text": "还是说只是装饰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 559, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 560, "text": "你是不是傻？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 561, "text": "毕竟，这里的大多数东西，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 562, "text": "都只是装个样子嘛！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 563, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 564, "text": "// BagWall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 565, "text": "你哪儿去了！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 566, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 567, "text": "这里可以通过？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 568, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 569, "text": "你找到新的bug了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 570, "text": "那里有什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 571, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 572, "text": "看样子…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 573, "text": "啥也没有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 574, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 575, "text": "噢，回来了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 576, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 577, "text": "// Quest 1 Glasses"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 578, "text": "你的视力很差吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 579, "text": "为什么戴着眼镜？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 580, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 581, "text": "怎么了？不喜欢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 582, "text": "这是我的个人风格！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 583, "text": "而且我的视力超好！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 584, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 585, "text": "// Quest 2 Name miLa"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 586, "text": "为什么是米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 587, "text": "或者说，为什么不是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 588, "text": "米卡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 589, "text": "或者米莎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 590, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 591, "text": "行了，我就叫米拉。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 592, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 593, "text": "我知道了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 594, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 595, "text": "// Quest 3 Evening"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 596, "text": "这黄昏的气氛还挺不错。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 597, "text": "还有多久就到晚上了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 598, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 599, "text": "晚上？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 600, "text": "还是别聊这个了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 601, "text": "简直就是在提醒我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 602, "text": "我只能度过无尽重复的每一天。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 603, "text": "日复一日，毫无变化…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 604, "text": "呼。"}
